target/
node_modules/
# Recordings for the Layer 5 data lake and the reports a run writes next to them.
# Untracked on purpose: a captured tape is gigabytes of market data, and a committed
# fixture would become the thing the gates are scored against.
# The operator names the folders at run time (--data .\data_test, --report .\runs\...), so
# ignore the family rather than one spelling: a gigabyte tape must never be catchable by a
# careless `git add .`, and no such file is tracked in this repository.
/data*/
/runs*/
*.jsonl
*.log
.next/
